cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "StereoDroidVR: a phone in a Cardboard-style viewer as a VR headset for SteamVR on Linux"
abstract: "StereoDroidVR is the Android phone headset project for PC VR with head tracking. KDE Connect pairing is required; picture, head pose and camera redirection share one RDP session. PC applications reach OpenXR, with OpenVR through xrizer. The complete tracked headset remains unqualified; this repository contains documentation, not an Android build target."
authors:
